OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm to be built near M4
OL,4,Adespite concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA solar farm capable of generating
OL,7,Fenough electricity to power thousands
OL,8,Fof homes will be built on farmland near
OL,9,Fthe M4, despite concerns over its
OL,10,Fimpact on the countryside.
OL,12,FWiltshire Council has granted planning
OL,13,Fpermission for Flaxlands Solar Farm at
OL,14,FFlaxlands Farm between Royal Wootton
OL,15,FBassett and Hook.
OL,17,FThe 49.9-megawatt solar farm on 87
OL,18,Fhectares of land will operate for up to
OL,19,F40 years; the development will also
OL,20,Ffeature a large battery energy storage
OL,21,Fsystem and new habitat creation areas.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
