OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm to be built near M4
OL,4,Adespite concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanning officers concluded that the
OL,7,Fsite's contribution to renewable energy
OL,8,Fgeneration, energy security and carbon
OL,9,Freduction outweighed concerns about its
OL,10,Fvisual impact and the temporary loss of
OL,11,Ffarmland.
